  "body_html": "<h1>dubinsSpanier_exists_proportional_allocation</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem dubinsSpanier_exists_proportional_allocation (n : ℕ) (hn : 0 &lt; n) (M : MeasureInstance (Fin n) I) [∀ i, IsFiniteMeasure (M.measure i)] [∀ i, NoAtoms (M.measure i)] : ∃ A : Allocation (Fin n) I, IsAllocation A ∧ M.IsProportional n A</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Allocation</li>\n<li>IsEnvyFree.isProportional</li>\n<li>IsProportional</li>\n<li>dubinsSpanierProportional</li>\n</ul>",
